      {
        "id": "n242",
        "type": "Dialog",
        "title": "Dialog",
        "body": "Klaasje (Miss Oranje Disco Dancer): “如果你这么说的话，警官——如果你想这么说的话。”\nKlaasje (Miss Oranje Disco Dancer): 她笑了，“我真不是。”\nKlaasje (Miss Oranje Disco Dancer): 她看着你，点了点头。\nKlaasje (Miss Oranje Disco Dancer): “最后它成了个霉斑遍布的第三世界贫民窟。”\nKlaasje (Miss Oranje Disco Dancer): “变成了会议中心。很多都是。”\nKlaasje (Miss Oranje Disco Dancer): “好吧。”她沉思着，长长地抽了一口阿斯特拉薄荷烟。",
        "x": 7260,
        "y": 12471,
        "width": 440,
        "height": 574,
        "turns": [
          {
            "speaker": "Klaasje (Miss Oranje Disco Dancer)",
            "line": "“如果你这么说的话，警官——如果你想这么说的话。”"
          },
          {
            "speaker": "Klaasje (Miss Oranje Disco Dancer)",
            "line": "她笑了，“我真不是。”"
          },
          {
            "speaker": "Klaasje (Miss Oranje Disco Dancer)",
            "line": "她看着你，点了点头。"
          },
          {
            "speaker": "Klaasje (Miss Oranje Disco Dancer)",
            "line": "“最后它成了个霉斑遍布的第三世界贫民窟。”"
          },
          {
            "speaker": "Klaasje (Miss Oranje Disco Dancer)",
            "line": "“变成了会议中心。很多都是。”"
          },
          {
            "speaker": "Klaasje (Miss Oranje Disco Dancer)",
            "line": "“好吧。”她沉思着，长长地抽了一口阿斯特拉薄荷烟。"
          }
        ],
        "manualSize": true,
        "ports": {
          "input": {
            "side": "left",
            "t": 0.5
